 "emoji": "🐕",
 "sentences": [
  "Meet Abutiu, an ancient Egyptian guard dog.",
  "He is one of the earliest documented domestic animals with a known name.",
  "He died before 2280 BC and received an elaborate ceremonial burial in the Giza Necropolis.",
  "An unknown pharaoh commanded this burial.",
  "Egyptologist George A. Reisner found the inscribed stone listing the funeral gifts in October 1935.",
  "The white limestone tablet features 10 vertical rows of hieroglyphs."
